      en: ["Spans approximately 7,400 square kilometers.", "Produces about 65% of the national GDP.", "The country's primary banana-growing region.", "Hydrologically dominated by the Ulúa and Chamelecón rivers.", "Home to San Pedro Sula, the industrial hub.", "Susceptible to major flooding during hurricanes."]
